2026.08.28 - 电影得闲谨制 Weibo update 🥰

Congratulations#电影得闲谨制# Nominated for seven awards at the 21st China Changchun Film Festival and won two major prizes.🎉🎉

The film “Idle Hands” has won the Best Film award.🏆;
Original Music by Guo Sida@郭star作曲 荣获 [Best Music] Award🏆;

The film “Idle Hands” has been nominated for the [Grand Jury Prize];
Director@孔笙 Nominated for Best Director;
Screenwriter Lan Xiaolong@伍千万里四十八 Nominated for Best Screenplay;
Cinematographer Zeng Jian has received a nomination for Best Cinematography.
Editing supervisors Lin Zhuangyu, Meng Peicong, and Li Tianming have been nominated for Best Editing.

Stories of home resonate, and the power of the ordinary moves the heart. We remain true to our original aspirations, and we are deeply grateful for the recognition of every viewer.❤️#得闲谨制[超话]# 

